OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits violent disorder at
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted to throwing a bottle
OL,7,Ftowards a police line and swearing at
OL,8,Fofficers during an anti-migrant protest
OL,9,Fin Portsmouth.
OL,11,FDel Somerville, 42, pleaded guilty at
OL,12,Fthe city's crown court to violent
OL,13,Fdisorder after the overnight protest at
OL,14,FEastney Marina on 6 September.
OL,16,FHe was the first person to be arrested
OL,17,Fover the disorder, which saw hundreds
OL,18,Fof protesters gather after a boat
OL,19,Fcarrying about 120 migrants was brought
OL,20,Fashore at nearby Eastney Beach.
